   <platform os="all" arch="noarch" version="1.9.5.1706:1.9.9">
      <package fileName="202611071320-epyscripts.tar.gz" sha1="7b3acbff547a9dd3d7df49357fa3d1135de3ab79" type="script" releaseDate="202611071320">
         <title>
            SmartIndicator Version 1.7.0
         </title>
         <description>
            <p>
               This update installs the script SmartIndicator Version 1.7.0
               for PixInsight.
            </p>
            <p>
               Under Script → Render you will find SmartIndicator. It enables you to generate and blend an indicator (scale, orientation, angular separation, text, or supernova) onto a target image. 
            </p>
            <p>
               Last update: <ul><li>Major refactoring and optimizations.</li><li>Indicator settings are now persisted across indicator switches and application restarts.</li><li>Preview rendering has been updated to reflect all parameter changes in real time.</li><li>Added support for applying indicators directly to a target image without leaving the SmartIndicator dialog.</li><li>Multiple indicators can now be applied sequentially to a single target image with no predefined limit.</li><li>The Text Indicator&apos;s Auto Position mode has been enhanced to automatically align text to the line endpoint when horizontal text alignment is selected and an arrowhead is enabled.</li><li>Added support for the Contained Windowing Mode.</li><li>Added the new Supernova Indicator for precise annotation of stars and other small celestial objects.</li></ul>
            </p>
            <p>
               Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Elmer Petry. All Rights Reserved.
            </p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
